        "description": {
          "en-US": "BEUConnect is a student app for Bihar Engineering University (BEU). The syllabus, previous year papers, notes, notices and college rosters live on the device, so most of it works without a connection.\n\nFeatures:\n* Syllabus for BEU branches and semesters, with topics, GATE papers and a saved list.\n* Previous year papers with PDFs and a paper finder.\n* Results from BEU's result API, a saved copy, the published result tables, or BEU's own result page.\n* University rank, merit list and a side-by-side result comparison.\n* Attendance tracker, SGPA calculator and predictor, routine and holiday calendar.\n* Notes, planner, notices and search across the bundled data.\n* Published college and branch rosters and CGPA leaders.\n\nData and privacy: a registration number is stored on the device and sent only to BEU's result endpoints to resolve a name and result. No account is required, and there are no ads or analytics. Feedback is sent only when you submit it.\n\nSource code: https://github.com/pritkr/beuConnect (AGPL-3.0-or-later).\n"
        },
